  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Thinly slice fennel.<br>• In a medium microwave-safe bowl, combine the <br>white wine vinegar and a good pinch of sugar<br>and salt.<br>• Scrunch sliced fennel in your hands, then add to <br>pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover <br>fennel. Microwave fennel, in 30 second bursts, <br>until warmed through. Set aside. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f848b3cade9b9f0ace1698/step-afa72000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While fennel is pickling, in a medium bowl, place <br>haloumi and cover with water to soak. <br>• Roughly shred baby cos lettuce.<br>• Thinly slice cucumber into rounds. <br>• Slice lemon into wedges. <br>• Finely chop garlic.<br>• In a small bowl, combine dill &amp; parsley <br>mayonnaise and Greek-style yoghurt.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f848b3cade9b9f0ace1698/step-b6f10310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into <br>bite-sized chunks.<br>• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of <br>olive oil over medium-high heat.<br>• Cook ciabatta, tossing, until golden and slightly <br>crispy, 5-6 minutes.<br>• Add garlic and another drizzle of olive oil, <br>tossing until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Transfer to a <br>large bowl. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f848b3cade9b9f0ace1698/step-a2145d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Drain haloumi, then pat dry. Cut haloumi into <br>1cm-thick slices.<br>• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high <br>heat with a drizzle of olive oil.<br>• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes<br>each side.<br>• Remove pan from heat, then add the honey and <br>a squeeze of lemon juice. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f848b3cade9b9f0ace1698/step-430a6030.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Drain pickled fennel.<br>• To the bowl with croutons, add pickled fennel, <br>cucumber, cos lettuce, a good squeeze of <br>lemon juice and a drizzle of olive oil. Toss to <br>combine and season to taste. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f848b3cade9b9f0ace1698/step-f3f4f640.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide pickled fennel crouton salad between <br>bowls. Top with honey haloumi and drizzle <br>over herby dressing. Sprinkle with everything <br>garnish (see ingredients). <br>• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f848b3cade9b9f0ace1698/step-649c9d50.jpg"
    }
  ]
